<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>When I R.I.P. (From "Euphoria: Season 1" Soundtrack)</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Labrinth</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Euphoria (Original Score from the HBO Series)</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">2t16D9V5FmmRAJjsSpwvZf</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:05.090" end="00:09.470">Cheer</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:09.470" end="00:12.740">They been waiting for me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.740" end="00:19.400" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.400" end="00:22.130">What the fuck? The fuck?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.130" end="00:27.510">Feel the morning on my face</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.510" end="00:32.710">Ain't a pill that I didn't take</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.710" end="00:34.980">Just alive tryin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.980" end="00:37.900">'Cause it's been a long day</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.900" end="00:45.050">'Cause I'm asleep when I R.I.P (ba-da-da-dam)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.050" end="00:47.750">Flashbacks</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.750" end="00:50.550">Relapse</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.550" end="00:52.150">Camera flash</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.150" end="00:55.980">And don't forget your hashtag</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.980" end="00:58.520">Rucksack</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.520" end="01:00.820">White stacks</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.820" end="01:03.130">You're a dead man</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.130" end="01:06.480">You better rid of that gat</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.480" end="01:07.980">You gonna run game</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.730" end="01:11.600">They don't never run you, uh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.600" end="01:13.120">When they bitchin' on your name</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.120" end="01:17.130">You say fuck you too, too</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.130" end="01:18.630">It's a fuckin' cold case</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.580" end="01:22.470">Give detective no clues, clues</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.470" end="01:23.970">'Cause I'm Indiana J</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.850" end="01:25.350">When I'm trippin' on the juice</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.090" end="01:27.880">Now let's get real quiet</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.880" end="01:30.930" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.930" end="01:38.930">Feel so, feel so stupid, woo!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.430" end="01:45.270" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.270" end="01:48.160">Ye-yeah, talk to me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.160" end="01:50.850">'Bout to make a big deal, uproar</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.850" end="01:53.330">And I'm in for the kill, La Roux</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.330" end="01:56.050">Bitches lookin' like a meal, contour</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.050" end="01:59.840">Percocet until we can't feel no more</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.840" end="02:05.200">And I smoked somethin' that gon' knock me out, out</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.200" end="02:08.260">Somehow this body won't just stay down, down</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.260" end="02:10.280">Now let's get real quiet</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.280" end="02:15.710">Feel the morning on my face</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.710" end="02:20.980">Ain't a pill that I didn't take (ba-da-ba-dam)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:20.980" end="02:26.160">Just alive tryin' 'cause it's been a long day (ba-da-ba-dam)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:26.160" end="02:31.110">'Cause I'm asleep when I R.I.P (ba-da-ba-dam)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:31.110" end="02:35.110" /></div></body></tt>